### MiniWallet — проверка API
### Расширение: REST Client (humao.rest-client) для VS Code.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_HERE

### 0. Health — сервис жив
GET {{host}}/health

### 1.1 Регистрация Alice
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alinursarsekov@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.2 Регистрация Bob
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.kz",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.3 Дубликат email — 409 email_taken
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alinursarsekov@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.4 Короткий пароль — 400 weak_password
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "eve@example.kz",
  "password": "short"
}

### 2.1 Логин Alice — скопируй token из ответа в @token сверху
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.kz",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.2 Логин с неверным паролем — 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.kz",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 3.1 Мой баланс (JWT)
GET {{host}}/accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Без токена — 401
GET {{host}}/accounts/me

### 4.1 Пополнение на 1000.50 KZT = 100050 тиынов
POST {{host}}/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 100050
}

### 4.2 Нулевая сумма — 400
POST {{host}}/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 0
}

### 5.1 Перевод Bob'у 300 тиынов (Idempotency-Key обязателен!)
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: my-first-transfer-001

{
  "to_email": "bob@example.kz",
  "amount": 300
}

### 5.2 Повтор с тем же ключом — вернётся тот же перевод (idempotent_replay: true)
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: my-first-transfer-001

{
  "to_email": "bob@example.kz",
  "amount": 300
}

### 5.3 Тот же ключ, другая сумма — 409 idempotency_conflict
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: my-first-transfer-001

{
  "to_email": "bob@example.kz",
  "amount": 500
}

### 5.4 Без ключа — 400 idempotency_key_required
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "to_email": "bob@example.kz",
  "amount": 100
}

### 5.5 Перевод самому себе — 400
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: self-001

{
  "to_email": "alice@example.kz",
  "amount": 100
}

### 5.6 Больше, чем есть на счету — 422 insufficient_funds
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: big-001

{
  "to_email": "bob@example.kz",
  "amount": 99999999
}

### 6.1 История операций (первые 20)
GET {{host}}/transactions?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.2 Пагинация: вторая страница по 2 записи
GET {{host}}/transactions?limit=2&offset=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
